                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Hunter to Mr. Hay.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Guatemala</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1899-01-28"><hi rendition="#italic">January 28, 1899</hi></date>.
                        (Received 10.54 p.m.,</dateline></opener>
                <p>Original credentials presented and have been officially recognized by President
                    Honduras; particulars by mail.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hunter.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
